From 4ca68559aa33711f496913c0ab678fbfde735724 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jan 2024 15:07:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 463/841] refactor(stm32mp2): move DDR PHY FW files in
 sub-directory

Move DDR PHY firmware files in an stm32mp2 sub-directory. This prepares
the fact that binary files cannot be upstreamed. The FW files can be
found at https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32-ddr-phy-binary.
This will allow users to clone this git directly in the folder
drivers/st/ddr/phy/firmware/bin when using an upstream software without
changing STM32MP_DDR_FW_PATH value.
The useless files are also removed.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git e4f2433027844e4fa1da2081273ec3df18e20bcd refactor(stm32mp2): move DDR PHY FW files in sub-directory]
Change-Id: Ie382fe8c76e62628b65704d9a05bf928c6bc942a
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/353704
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Nicolas LE BAYON <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
